Here is the React component code. I have used a `className` prop to allow you to easily switch between the two variants.

```jsx
import React from 'react';

const Layout = ({ children, variant = 'centered' }) => {
  return (
    <div className={variant === 'full-width' ? 'w-full' : 'max-w-[1000px] mx-auto'}>
      {children}
    </div>
  );
